p=20class=3DForewordText>ISO=20(the=20International=20Organization=20for=20=
Standardization)=20is=20a=20worldwide=20federation=20of=20national=20standa=
rds=20bodies=20(ISO=20member=20bodies).=20The=20work=20of=20preparing=20Int=
ernational=20Standards=20is=20normally=20carried=20out=20through=20ISO=20te=
chnical=20committees.=20Each=20member=20body=20interested=20in=20a=20subjec=
t=20for=20which=20a=20technical=20committee=20has=20been=20established=20ha=
s=20the=20right=20to=20be=20represented=20on=20that=20committee.=20Internat=
ional=20organizations,=20governmental=20and=20non-governmental,=20in=20liai=
son=20with=20ISO,=20also=20take=20part=20in=20the=20work.=20ISO=20collabora=
tes=20closely=20with=20the=20International=20Electrotechnical=20Commission=20=
(IEC)=20on=20all=20matters=20of=20electrotechnical=20standardization.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DForewordText>The=20procedures=20used=20to=20develop=20this=20d=
ocument=20and=20those=20intended=20for=20its=20further=20maintenance=20are=20=
described=20in=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=201.=20In=20particular=20=
the=20different=20approval=20criteria=20needed=20for=20the=20different=20ty=
pes=20of=20ISO=20documents=20should=20be=20noted.=20This=20document=20was=20=
drafted=20in=20accordance=20with=20the=20editorial=20rules=20of=20the=20ISO=
/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=202=20(see=20www.iso.org/directives).</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DForewordText>Attention=20is=20drawn=20to=20the=20possibility=20that=
=20some=20of=20the=20elements=20of=20this=20document=20may=20be=20the=20sub=
ject=20of=20patent=20rights.=20ISO=20shall=20not=20be=20held=20responsible=20=
for=20identifying=20any=20or=20all=20such=20patent=20rights.=20Details=20of=
=20any=20patent=20rights=20identified=20during=20the=20development=20of=20t=
he=20document=20will=20be=20in=20the=20Introduction=20and/or=20on=20the=20I=
SO=20list=20of=20patent=20declarations=20received=20(see=20www.iso.org/pate=
nts).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Any=20trade=20name=20used=20in=20this=
=20document=20is=20information=20given=20for=20the=20convenience=20of=20use=
rs=20and=20does=20not=20constitute=20an=20endorsement.=20For=20an=20explana=
tion=20on=20the=20voluntary=20nature=20of=20standards,=20the=20meaning=20of=
=20ISO=20specific=20terms=20and=20expressions=20related=20to=20conformity=20=
assessment,=20as=20well=20as=20information=20about=20ISO=E2=80=99s=20adhere=
nce=20to=20the=20World=20Trade=20Organization=20(WTO)=20principles=20in=20t=
he=20Technical=20Barriers=20to=20Trade=20(TBT)=20see=20the=20following=20UR=
L:=20www.iso.org/iso/foreword.html.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>This=20=
document=20was=20prepared=20by=20Technical=20Committee=20ISO/TC=20<i>28</i>=
,=20<i>Petroleum=20and=20related=20products,=20fuels=20and=20lubricants=20f=
rom=20natural=20or=20synthetic=20sources</i>,=20Subcommittee=20<i>SC</i>=20=
<i>4</i>,=20<i>Classifications=20and=20specifications</i>.</p>=0A<p=20class=
=3DForewordText>Any=20feedback=20or=20questions=20on=20this=20document=20sh=
ould=20be=20directed=20to=20the=20user=E2=80=99s=20national=20standards=20b=
ody.=20A=20complete=20listing=20of=20these=20bodies=20can=20be=20found=20at=
=20.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-specia=
l-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DI=
ntroTitle>Introduction</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20document=20was=20=
developed=20in=20cooperation=20with=20ship=20owners,=20ship=20operators,=20=
classification=20societies,=20fuel=20testing=20services,=20engine=20designe=
rs,=20marine=20fuel=20suppliers,=20traders,=20fuel=20additive=20suppliers=20=
and=20the=20petroleum=20industry,=20in=20view=20of=20the=20implementation=20=
of=20maximum=200,50=20mass=20%=20S=20in=20marine=20fuels=20in=202020=20for=20=
operation=20outside=20Emission=20Control=20Areas=20(ECAs).</p>=0A<p=20class=
=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A=0A</div>=0A=0A<br=20clear=3D"all"=20c=
lass=3D"section"=20/>=0A=0A<div=20class=3D>=0A=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle1>Pe=
troleum=20products=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Fuels=20(class=20F)=20=E2=80=94=
=20Considerations=20for=20fuel=20suppliers=20and=20users=20regarding=20mari=
ne=20fuel=20quality=20in=20view=20of=20the=20implementation=20of=20maximum=20=
0,50=20%=20sulfur=20in=202020</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Scope</h1>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20document=20addresses=20quality=20consideratio=
ns=20that=20apply=20to=20marine=20fuels=20in=20view=20of=20the=20implementa=
tion=20of=20maximum=200,50=20mass=20%=20S=20in=202020=20and=20the=20range=20=
of=20marine=20fuels=20that=20will=20be=20placed=20on=20the=20market=20in=20=
response=20to=20the=20international=20statutory=20requirements=20to=20reduc=
e=20exhaust=20gas=20emissions.=20It=20defines=20general=20requirements=20th=
at=20apply=20to=20all=200,50=20mass=20%=20sulfur=20(S)=20fuels=20and=20conf=
irms=20the=20applicability=20of=20ISO=208217=20for=20those=20fuels.</p>=0A<=
p=20class=3DMsoNormal>=E2=80=A6=E2=80=8B</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>No=
